  "translation_assessment": "Gazebo 8.15 consumes added mass through inertial.fluid_added_mass using positive Capytaine coefficients and Hydrodynamics consumes damping with negative resisting-force signs. This avoids the legacy tutorial's negative added-mass plugin form, which made the surface craft's augmented mass indefinite. MMG propeller/rudder interaction derivatives cannot be consumed directly by LiftDrag; the rudder therefore retains explicitly marked geometry/tutorial defaults and is a separate independent approximation. alpha_1 and alpha_2 were verified present in 8.15 but are intentionally omitted because 8.15 warns they are ignored when thrust_coefficient is supplied directly."
